# Peregrine Ridge: a fast, undulating kart circuit across the chalk downs.
# Units in metres: x east, z south, from the world's north-west corner.
track peregrine size 512 style downs
title PEREGRINE RIDGE
blurb A fast, flowing circuit across the chalk downs: a long drafting straight, a banked climb up Falcon Crest, a tight ridge hairpin, a plunge into the Chalk Bowl, and technical S-bends over West Knoll.
race laps 3 rivals 3 vehicle kart
road 14.5 bank 1.25
land 32 5
hour 16.5

